# needed. Once Muck Rats is cast, Rat King taps and sacrifices himself, the token and Muck Rats (CR 701.21): the target Typhoid
# Rats and the other Typhoid Rats of the graveyard return together, tapped. The third is not in the graveyard and stays put, and
# neither does the Typhoid Rats Bot2 Entombed on turn 2: "from your graveyard" is only Bot1's.

